    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967030/extras/09c5b30b0fdd9a9708752b3f1e119660.avif?t=1753136579\" width=600 height=100 /></span>Step into the high heels of a nightclub hostess and defend your territory in an over-the-top third-person zombie shooter. When the undead crash the party, it is time to grab your weapon and show them who is boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through waves of increasingly deadly zombies in a vibrant, neon-lit nightclub setting. Start with a basic pistol, earn score for each kill, and use it to purchase powerful new weapons or unlock fresh areas of the map. Survive round after round, upgrade your loadout, and reclaim your club.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you are fighting solo or partying up with friends in multiplayer, teamwork and firepower are your keys to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967030/extras/d65f90ce13f53b48d8db27cb935e58e5.avif?t=1753136579\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeating invaders earns youscore, which can be spent on upgrading your arsenal. Invest in powerful weapons to ramp up your firepower, allowing you to eliminate waves of undead more efficiently. The stronger your gear, the better your chances of survival! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967030/extras/84321804070801b50927e3502ab876ba.poster.avif?t=1753136579\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967030/extras/84321804070801b50927e3502ab876ba.webm?t=1753136579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967030/extras/84321804070801b50927e3502ab876ba.mp4?t=1753136579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967030/extras/094ed9f59065fa868a6c4e173244f23b.avif?t=1753136579\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exterminate the undeads and reclaim your territory\u2014 stay aware of your surroundings, fight with everything you have got, and push back the horde. Only the strongest will survive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967030/extras/4c518281365e0535e5e166d225d20549.poster.avif?t=1753136579\" width=600 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967030/extras/4c518281365e0535e5e166d225d20549.webm?t=1753136579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967030/extras/4c518281365e0535e5e166d225d20549.mp4?t=1753136579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967030/extras/a0d00a0d11f295bd1ad7a78dad643ff7.avif?t=1753136579\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Never underestimate the undeads. They are faster, stronger, and deadlier than they seem. Keep moving or you might be the next to bite the dust! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967030/extras/66c320b76db00f2b0e27c26a2fd94bdd.poster.avif?t=1753136579\" width=600 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967030/extras/66c320b76db00f2b0e27c26a2fd94bdd.webm?t=1753136579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967030/extras/66c320b76db00f2b0e27c26a2fd94bdd.mp4?t=1753136579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967030/extras/0720be33b856327b66dca8691bf5d9c0.avif?t=1753136579\" width=600 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with your allies, strength lies in numbers! Watch each other\u2019s backs, strategize together, and increase your chances of survival against the zombies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967030/extras/cdff37df5e8cf36f3fc6947732eea275.poster.avif?t=1753136579\" width=600 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967030/extras/cdff37df5e8cf36f3fc6947732eea275.webm?t=1753136579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967030/extras/cdff37df5e8cf36f3fc6947732eea275.mp4?t=1753136579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967030/extras/09c5b30b0fdd9a9708752b3f1e119660.avif?t=1753136579\" width=600 height=100 /></span>Step into the high heels of a nightclub hostess and defend your territory in an over-the-top third-person zombie shooter. When the undead crash the party, it is time to grab your weapon and show them who is boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through waves of increasingly deadly zombies in a vibrant, neon-lit nightclub setting. Start with a basic pistol, earn score for each kill, and use it to purchase powerful new weapons or unlock fresh areas of the map. Survive round after round, upgrade your loadout, and reclaim your club.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you are fighting solo or partying up with friends in multiplayer, teamwork and firepower are your keys to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967030/extras/d65f90ce13f53b48d8db27cb935e58e5.avif?t=1753136579\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeating invaders earns youscore, which can be spent on upgrading your arsenal. Invest in powerful weapons to ramp up your firepower, allowing you to eliminate waves of undead more efficiently. The stronger your gear, the better your chances of survival! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967030/extras/84321804070801b50927e3502ab876ba.poster.avif?t=1753136579\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967030/extras/84321804070801b50927e3502ab876ba.webm?t=1753136579\" t